  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When He Lang Zi is immobilized again and asks the name, Qin Bai Sheng answers and offers submission or death. Ordinary beast transformations and body strength fail without immortal methods that resist soul path techniques.",
      "chapters": [
        772
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He mainly cultivates soul path and secondarily metal path, and this immortal killer move is a common technique of his. The gap in soul foundation is what makes the cast immense; in Luo Po Valley one use defeats He Lang Zi in giant wolf form, and later he immobilizes an inkman Gu Immortal with it before a metal path beheading. Against Lang Ya land spirit the move does nothing, because the land spirit has no soul: it is an obsession formed with heavenly power, neither real nor fake body nor soul, so soul suppression cannot land.",
      "chapters": [
        880
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "foundation-and-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Mo Tan Sang remain vulnerable unless they have a way to resist that soul path attack.",
      "chapters": [
        881
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "target-vulnerability",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_mo_tan_sang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Heavenly Giant Solor their soul foundations add together, so even if the move still works it no longer decides the fight alone.",
      "chapters": [
        883
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shared-soul-foundation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He activates it again in the later Lang Ya clash amid light and fire. Fang Yuan, not in perfect condition, judges that facing Qin Bai Sheng and this move leaves him no strength to strike back.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Feng Jiu Ge he casts it as a powerful soul path technique aimed at Feng Jiu Ge’s face; among Qin Bai Sheng’s two major trump cards it pairs with the sword path killer move five finger fist heart sword, and ordinary Gu Immortals cannot endure even one hit from him.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ge-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    }
